flowchart TB
  DEF[Product definition] --> FACTORY[Build-time resolver and factory]
  MOD[Reviewed domain manifests and implementations] --> FACTORY
  FACTORY --> PLAN[Per-product exact composition and artifacts]
  PLAN --> WEB[Maintained Web shell]
  PLAN --> API[Maintained backend host]
  PLAN --> JOB[Optional worker host]
  WEB -->|declared own-module operations| API
  API --> OWN[Selected domain owners]
  JOB -->|fenced owner commit| OWN
  OWN --> SQL[Owner-local persistence]
  OWN --> PORT[Public capability]
  WIRE[Product-owned solution wiring] --> PORT
  WIRE --> DEST[Other product public operation]
